abs/2506.23270\n\nMultimodal LLMs\nScaling Laws for Native Multimodal Models\nhttps://github.com/xmed-lab/TAM https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.07951\n\nMultimodal Learning\nDifferential-informed Sample Selection Accelerates Multimodal Contrastive Learning\nhttps://github.com/MediaBrain-SJTU/DISSect https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.12998\n\nMultimodal Learning\nUnderstanding Co-speech Gestures in-the-wild\nhttps://github.com/Sindhu-Hegde/jegal https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.22668\n\nMultimodal Learning\nDifferentiable Room Acoustic Rendering with Multi-View Vision Priors\nhttps://github.com/MediaBrain-SJTU/DISSect https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.21847\n\nObject Detection\nCounting Stacked Objects\nhttps://github.com/MediaBrain-SJTU/DISSect https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.21847\n\nObject Detection\nAutomated Model Evaluation for Object Detection via Prediction Consistency and Reliability\nhttps://github.com/YonseiML/autoeval-det https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.12082\n\nImage Editing\nFlowEdit: Inversion-Free Text-Based Editing Using Pre-Trained Flow Models\nhttps://github.com/YonseiML/autoeval-det https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.12082\n\nVideo Restoration & Enhancement\nMIORe & VAR-MIORe: Benchmarks to Push the Boundaries of Restoration\nhttps://github.com/george200150/MIORe https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.06803\n\nTrustworthy AI\nSoft Local Completeness: Rethinking Completeness in Model Explainability\nhttps://github.com/xaisloc/sloc https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.08629\n\nImage Retrieval\nLearning Visual Hierarchies in Hyperbolic Space for Image Retrieval\nhttps://github.com/xaisloc/sloc https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.17490\n\nModel Acceleration\nVariance-Based Pruning for Accelerating and Compressing Trained Networks\nhttps://github.com/Kebii/MikuDance https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.12988\n\nModel Acceleration\nImportance-Based Token Merging for Efficient Image and Video Generation\nhttps://github.com/Kebii/MikuDance https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.16720\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ba8deca3a5917b85\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1785414849267}}
