penaccess.thecvf.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"ICCV 2025 oral papers program pdf","provider":"brave","count":10,"tookMs":1647,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"brave","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4bedebe4ec37d53e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nICCV 2025\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4bedebe4ec37d53e\">>>","url":"https://iccv.thecvf.com/","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"22ff34cc4d5ad1bf\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOct 29: Keynote and Oral Session Videos are available. Oct 22: The reception tonight is 6:30 - 8:00 pm in the Coral Ballroom at the Hilton · Oct 19: The Prayer / Quiet Room / Mother’s Room will be available Tuesday through Thursday. Oct 5: ISEMV co-located workshop: ISEMV 2025 &quot;Where Virtual Meets Reality:The Rise of the Metaverse&quot; Register NOW · Sep 24: Main Conference Program PDF, and Tutorials / Workshops Program PDF are posted.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"22ff34cc4d5ad1bf\">>>","siteName":"iccv.thecvf.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"84d809cdd39c333d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nICCV.2025 - Oral | Cool Papers - Immersive Paper Discovery\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"84d809cdd39c333d\">>>","url":"https://papers.cool/venue/ICCV.2025?group=Oral","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cfd0894dacd04df3\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe list of accepted papers for ICCV.2025 - Oral, including titles, authors, and abstracts, with support for paper interpretation based on Kimi AI.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cfd0894dacd04df3\">>>","siteName":"papers.cool"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cf7a1b0d20d51c5e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGitHub - yejun688/iccv-2025-oral-papers: 😎 A curated list of ICCV 2025 Oral paper. End\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cf7a1b0d20d51c5e\">>>","url":"https://github.com/yejun688/iccv-2025-oral-papers","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"81be8dabeb223f25\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n😎 A curated list of ICCV 2025 Oral paper. End. Contribute to yejun688/iccv-2025-oral-papers development by creating an account on GitHub.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"81be8dabeb223f25\">>>","siteName":"github.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95b93de3f99c2d1d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOrals - ICCV 2025 - The Computer Vision Foundation\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95b93de3f99c2d1d\">>>","url":"https://iccv.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/events/oral","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"79d6c64aa508e676\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThrough an in-depth analysis of previous approaches, we identify two key insights: (1) IL arises from identity information embedded within motion features, and (2) this identity information can be leveraged to address RA. Building on these findings, this paper introduces FixTalk, a novel framework designed to simultaneously resolve both issues for high-quality talking head generation.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"79d6c64aa508e676\">>>","siteName":"iccv.thecvf.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e0a81b142814fc0b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nDATE 18-Oct 19-Oct 20-Oct October 21 October 22 October 23 Time 7:30 AM\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e0a81b142814fc0b\">>>","url":"https://media.eventhosts.cc/Conferences/ICCV2025/ProgramOverview.pdf","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"026854a9d830f647\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOral 3A: Foundation models and representation · Oral 3B: Human Modeling (6)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"026854a9d830f647\">>>","siteName":"media.eventhosts.cc"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1cd6df254ec6e7fc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nPROGRAM - MAIN CONFERENCE - EventHosts\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1cd6df254ec6e7fc\">>>","url":"https://media.eventhosts.cc/Conferences/ICCV202